OL,3,GNEWSABristol then and now: Fashion and
OL,4,Arailway stations
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe main entrance to Bristol's biggest
OL,7,Fstation does not appear vastly
OL,8,Fdifferent in these two photographs -
OL,9,Fthe first taken in July 1926. Look
OL,10,Fcloser at the clock tower however, and
OL,11,Fyou will see the spire is missing. It
OL,12,Fwas destroyed by an incendiary bomb in
OL,13,FJanuary 1941. The cars parked outside
OL,14,Fin the 1926 image would no doubt get
OL,15,Fvintage vehicle enthusiasts excited.
